---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout>
  <main class="page wide">
    <section class="page-intro about-intro">
      <div>
        <h1>About Me</h1>
        <p>
          Hi, I'm Andrew! Born and raised in Indonesia. I'm a junior at Arizona State University studying
          Applied Business and Technology Solutions, with a Computer Science
          foundation from Diablo Valley College.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside of school, you'll find me producing music and DJing as SHIDEN,
          playing soccer and padel, or working on my golf game.
        </p>
        <p class="scroll-hint">Scroll ↓</p>
      </div>
      <figure>
        <img src="/about.JPG" alt="Portrait of me" />
        <figcaption>Andrew Damanik · Tempe, AZ</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <div class="content">
      <section class="reveal">
        <h2>Who I Am</h2>
        <p>
          I sit where business and technology meet. I co-founded Kopi Deo, a
          restaurant in Jakarta, and learned product thinking the hands-on way:
          listening to customers, spotting what was missing from the menu, and
          shipping changes that moved revenue.
        </p>
        <p>
          In school, I've led student teams building websites for a nonprofit,
          designed user flows for a campus app, and worked with data on machine
          learning projects. What ties it all together is that I like figuring
          out what people actually need, then organizing the team and the work
          to build it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal">
        <h2>What I'm Looking For</h2>
        <p>
          I'm currently looking for <strong>Summer 2027 internships</strong> in product
          management or technology consulting, preferrably on teams working with AI,
          data, or consumer products. If you're hiring or just want to chat,
        </p>
        <p>
          <a href="mailto:andrewhasintongan@gmail.com">send me an email</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal">
        <h2>What I'm Working On</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>
            Building this portfolio with Agile/Scrum, with sprints and a backlog
            in Jira linked to GitHub.
          </li>
          <li>Supporting operations at Kopi Deo from Arizona.</li>
          <li>Producing new music as SHIDEN.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal">
        <h2>Skills</h2>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Category</th>
              <th>Skills</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Product</td>
              <td
                >Agile/Scrum, Jira, user research, process design, project
                management</td
              >
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Design</td>
              <td>Figma, UI/UX design, user flows, wireframing</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Data</td>
              <td>Excel/Sheets, data analysis</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Languages</td>
              <td>Python, C/C++, Swift, HTML/CSS</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Tools</td>
              <td>Git, GitHub, VS Code, Astro, Vercel, Claude Code</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-intro p + p {
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  figure {
    margin: 0;
  }

  figure img {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 380px;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 4px;
    display: block;
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  figcaption {
    margin-top: 12px;
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .content section {
    padding: 48px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .content h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .content ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  .content li {
    margin: 8px 0;
  }

  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
  }

  th {
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
    padding: 0 16px 12px 0;
  }

  td {
    padding: 14px 16px 14px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    vertical-align: top;
  }

  td:first-child {
    font-weight: 500;
    width: 140px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .about-intro {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
    figure img {
      margin: 0;
    }
    figcaption {
      text-align: left;
    }
  }
</style>
